  "description":"Exercise92 source-supplied AMNC section of a parallelepiped, not a cube: all eight named vertices, M on A1B1, N on B1C1, twelve complete edges, solid AM/MN/NC, separate dashed AC and hidden AD/DC/DD1. Dense diagonal hatching is clipped to the complete AMNC region including its narrow N/C end. Modern typographic hatch clearances only around B1, D and alpha are explicitly declared; no boundary or edge is erased. Junction labels use hidden construction markers rather than adding point disks. No dimensions, right angles, equal-edge claims, extra diagonals, limiting-case panels or answers to other tasks.",
  "source":{
    "image":{"path":"ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-38.png","sha256":"92ec64480888b3a67b21679dc81dad02914572978f145218e2bdd19b033e4665"},
    "authoritativeText":[
      {"lesson":"geo910-c1-s1-n11","text":"§11. 关于平行平面的定理"},
      {"lesson":"geo910-c1-s1-n11","exercise":"92","text":"92. 作平行六面体 $ABCDA_1B_1C_1D_1$ 的截面，截平面 $\\alpha$ 通过顶点 $A$、$C$ 和棱 $A_1B_1$ 上的点 $M$（图 38）。\n\n解。作线段 $AC$ 和 $MN$，得到平面 $\\alpha$ 与两个面的交线。\n平面 $\\alpha$ 与面 $A_1B_1C_1D_1$ 的交线平行于 $(AC)$（§11 定理 7），因此作 $[MN]\\parallel[AC]$。\n最后作线段 $NC$，梯形 $AMNC$ 就是所求截面。\n\n如果 $M=B_1$，所求截面是三角形 $AB_1C$；如果 $M=A_1$，截面是平行四边形 $AA_1C_1C$。\n解是唯一的（公理 4）。"}
    ],
